.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Data records, options, event payloads, and value types used by the JavaScript API\&. 

These names describe the structure of values accepted or returned by PDG\&. They are documentation types, not constructors or additional runtime exports\&. Follow a type's fields and ownership notes when creating or retaining a value; native handles must be obtained from the documented factory or getter\&. 
