.SH "struct pdg::AnimationDrawableOptions"
.PP 
Options shared by both \fBSprite\&.addAnimationDrawable\fP overloads\&. 


.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
Documentation-only JavaScript shape, not a runtime constructor\&.
.RE
.PP
 
.PP
\fBFields\fP
.RS 4
Field  Type  Required/default  Meaning  bone  \fRstring\fP or \fRnumber\fP int  Required  Existing bone name or zero-based bone ID\&.  bounds  \fBAnimationDrawingBounds\fP  Optional  Omit if safe bounds are unknown\&.  order  \fRnumber\fP int  0  Lower values draw first within the same placement and slot; ties preserve registration order\&.  placement  \fRnumber\fP int  animationDraw_AfterAll  Use an animationDraw placement constant\&.  slot  \fRstring\fP  ""  Required for slot placements; omit for BeforeAll and AfterAll\&.  strokeSpace  \fRnumber\fP int  animationStroke_PortPixels  Use an animationStroke constant\&.  uncullable  \fRboolean\fP  Optional  Defaults to true without bounds and false with bounds\&.   
.RE
.PP

.PP
