.RS 4
object \fIbone\fP Existing bone name or zero-based bone ID\&. Type: \fRstring\fP or \fRnumber\fP int\&. Required\&. 
.br
.PP
\fBAnimationDrawingBounds\fP \fIbounds\fP Omit if safe bounds are unknown\&. Type: \fBAnimationDrawingBounds\fP\&. Optional\&. 
.br
.PP
int \fIorder\fP Lower values draw first within the same placement and slot; ties preserve registration order\&. Type: \fRnumber\fP int\&. Optional\&. Default: \fR0\fP\&. 
