.br
.PP
int \fIstrokeSpace\fP Use an animationStroke constant\&. Type: \fRnumber\fP int\&. Optional\&. Default: \fRanimationStroke_PortPixels\fP\&. 
.br
.PP
boolean \fIuncullable\fP Defaults to true without bounds and false with bounds\&. Type: \fRboolean\fP\&. Optional\&. 
.br
.PP
